after first ask [
  `Message from Assistant: ◇ Assistant I'll work on "first job" in the background and tell you when it is done.`,
  'Task: first job: first job Running 1 of 8 steps finished. The server is running this task. Done: Collect what is known about first job Cancel task'
]
after second ask [
  `Message from Assistant: ◇ Assistant I'll work on "second job" in the background and tell you when it is done. A task is already running in this conversation. Add a step to it or start a new conv`,
  'Task: first job: first job Running 2 of 8 steps finished. The server is running this task. Done: Collect what is known about first job Done: Compare the options for first job Cancel task'
]
tasks t+0 [
  'Task: first job => first job Running 2 of 8 steps finished. The server is running this task. Done: Collect what is known about first job Done: Compar'
]
cancel buttons for first job 1
tasks after cancel +1.5s [
